# Pyokotan no Dai Meiro (NES) — starter table, generated from supplied ROM.
# Encoding confidence:
# - 0x20–0x7E: ASCII confirmed by embedded readable text records.
# - 0xA1–0xDF: JIS X 0201 half-width katakana mapping, consistent with the CHR font glyphs;
#   confirm the exact code-to-tile path during runtime before injecting translated text.
# - 0x90: visually duplicates the long-vowel dash tile at 0xB0.
# - 0x80–0x9F except 0x90, and 0xE0–0xFF: unknown / game-specific glyphs shown as byte markers.
# - 0x00–0x1F are not mapped here because they may be control codes / terminators.
# The <XX> values are inspection placeholders, not actual game characters.
